    "created_at": "2021-05-22T01:38:48Z",
    "updated_at": "2021-05-22T01:38:48Z",
    "body": "3986 [defines userinfo](https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc3986.html#section-3.2.1) to include `sub-delims`, which includes `'`.\r\n\r\n~~~ abnf\r\nuserinfo    = *( unreserved / pct-encoded / sub-delims / \":\" )\r\nunreserved  = ALPHA / DIGIT / \"-\" / \".\" / \"_\" / \"~\"\r\nsub-delims  = \"!\" / \"$\" / \"&\" / \"'\" / \"(\" / \")\"\r\n              / \"*\" / \"+\" / \",\" / \";\" / \"=\"\r\n~~~\r\n\r\nSo, it needs to be unescaped. Same for `;`.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
    "reactions": {
      "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/whatwg/url/issues/comments/846329500/reactions",
